review:
Been here since 2018;
Completely happy the whole time.
Would definitely recommend Sun Plaza to anyone searching.

My wife and I lived here years ago and made an "unofficial" visit to the property recently. It has aged well;
the neighborhood and the city of East Cleveland in general is very poor--but Crystal Tower is secure and
a fine location enjoy and observe the Cleveland area
from the higher floors. If we moved back to the area,
Crystal Tower would receive first priority.

