Ticks all the boxes;
Clean, great neighbors, responsive office and maintenance staff, ample parking, noise free and clean environment, proximity to major stores, (Walmart, costco, frys..) restaurants, parks, bus services ...... Management always improving/upgrading facilities!
If they had a 3 bedroom, I would have stayed longer- Had to move with my family getting bigger!
